2. DOMAIN SETUP (17 Nov 2026)
-----------------------------
Problem: kafelembaran.com showed "This site doesn't support a secure connection". The domain still
pointed to the Exabytes parking IP 103.7.9.22, and Exabytes has no DNS editor for this domain
(the only addon is Domain Privacy).

Fix: DNS moved to Cloudflare.
Cloudflare (account Kafelembaran@gmail), DNS records:
    A      @    185.199.108.153   DNS only (grey)
    A      @    185.199.109.153   DNS only
    A      @    185.199.110.153   DNS only
    A      @    185.199.111.153   DNS only
    CNAME  www  kafelembaran.github.io   DNS only
  - Removed: the three A records (*, @, www) pointing to 103.7.9.22.
  - Records stay grey (not proxied) so GitHub can issue the HTTPS certificate.
  - Zone status: Active ("Your domain is now protected by Cloudflare").
Exabytes nameservers: custom, set to yichun.ns.cloudflare.com and kira.ns.cloudflare.com
  (replacing ns184, ns185 and ns186.mschosting.com).
GitHub Settings > Pages: custom domain kafelembaran.com saved.
  - Status at 11:38: "DNS check unsuccessful" (NotServedByPagesError). Expected while the old
    records are still cached.

Remaining:
  [ ] Click "Check again" in GitHub Pages until it shows "DNS check successful"
      (15 minutes to a few hours).
  [ ] Tick "Enforce HTTPS" once it can be ticked.
  [ ] Open https://kafelembaran.com on a phone: padlock shown, book page loads.
  [ ] Optional, after HTTPS works: switch the records to proxied (orange) with SSL/TLS set to "Full".

Side effect: while DNS propagates, kafelembaran.github.io/kafelembaran.com also redirects to
kafelembaran.com, so the site is unreachable for a while. After HTTPS works, the canonical
addresses are:
  - website: https://kafelembaran.com
  - video files: https://kafelembaran.com/media/<slug>.mp4

Security notes:
